# This directory stores preprocessed training/validation/test splits
# Generated after font rendering and dataset splitting

# Files created here:
# - train.npz (training split)
# - val.npz (validation split) 
# - test.npz (test split)

# Each .npz file contains:
# - images: (N, 48, 48) uint8 glyph bitmaps
# - targets: (N, 64) float32 line segment coordinates (16 segments × 4 coords)
# - chars: (N,) character codes

# Note: Initially targets are dummy random data
# In a full implementation, targets would be ground truth line segments
# extracted from font vector data or manual annotation